WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
You brought enough firewood to burn for half a night

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The soil you dug is less than half a box

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,220
Half a fish is already a kindness to me

4
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:08,220
Lin Feng, you did this on purpose

5
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,220
Yes, I did it on purpose

6
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,220
Why don’t you want it? If you don’t want it, just let it go.

7
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:15,050
You wait

8
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:25,880
I moved firewood all day

9
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:26,880
Half a box of soil was dug

10
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:27,880
He gave me half a fish

11
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,910
What else did he say?

12
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:31,650
Said he did it on purpose

13
00:00:31,650 --> 00:00:32,740
Sister Weiwei

14
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,740
Whoever gets the job will get it

15
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,740
I won't go even if I die tomorrow

16
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:39,740
It's our turn, no one can escape tomorrow

17
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:45,870
Let Shen Xiaotang go tomorrow

18
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:48,480
Weiwei Xiaotang is the youngest

19
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:51,220
It's not appropriate to go to her place.

20
00:00:51,220 --> 00:00:52,220
She acts cute every day and pretends to follow instructions

21
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,220
Aren’t you the best at pleasing men?

22
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:55,220
let her go

23
00:00:55,220 --> 00:00:57,220
Maybe I can get a frame of something back in exchange

24
00:00:57,220 --> 00:00:58,820
Feel sorry for her

25
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,880
Then go by yourself

26
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:02,880
Today she

27
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,880
Tomorrow I

28
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,880
Take turns

29
00:01:04,880 --> 00:01:06,880
No one can run away
